      targeting specialised tonnage once qualified: LNG and LPG carriers, chemical tankers, and offshore support
      vessels all require additional gas-carrier or dynamic-positioning endorsements on top of the base COC, and
      all pay a genuine premium over standard bulk or container ships. Officers who build this specific
      <strong>high-value skill portfolio</strong>, MEO progression plus a scarce vessel-type endorsement, reach
      stronger income and earlier financial freedom faster than officers who stay on generic tonnage indefinitely.
    </p>
