  <p>
    Marine engineering has a real, documented placement-fraud problem, and it deserves a dedicated, direct
    warning rather than a passing mention. Fake manning agents and doctored sea-time paperwork have derailed
    genuinely qualified candidates' careers.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
